in: `android-setup 34 34.0.0`, download Gradle 8.9, generate wrapper.\n2. [x] git init, branch `agent/432hz-app`, commit plan.\n3. [x] Scaffold Android project (Kotlin, AGP 8.5.2, Gradle 8.9, compileSdk 34, minSdk 24).\n4. [x] DSP core (pure Kotlin, JVM-testable):\n       - [x] Radix-2 FFT.\n       - [x] Phase vocoder (STFT stretch, Hann window, hop N/4, parabolic peak frequency correction).\n       - [x] Windowed-sinc resampler.\n       - [x] PitchShifter = stretch by ratio + resample back (duration preserved).\n5. [x] Media pipeline: MediaExtractor+MediaCodec decode to PCM float; DSP per channel; MediaCodec AAC + MediaMuxer re-encode. Progress callback.\n6. [x] UI: pick audio file (SAF), source/target tuning fields with presets, convert button, progress, save to Downloads (MediaStore, API 29+; app dir fallback), play + share result.\n7. [x] Unit tests: FFT correctness, sine 440 Hz → 432 Hz peak, duration preserved, stretch preserves frequency. Run with `./gradlew test`.\n8. [x] Build debug APK: `./gradlew assembleDebug`. Fix until it builds.\n9. [x] Install-check not possible (no device); note in report.\n10. [x] Commit work; write AGENT_REPORT.md.\n\n## Follow-up tasks (2026-11-08)\n\n11. [x] (a) Fix end-of-buffer crash in PhaseVocoder (numOut from x.size, buffer >= outLen); add long-input boundary tests; check Resampler/Converter boundaries; memory estimate for 4-min FLAC.\n12. [x] (b) Launcher activity shows \"432 Hz Converter\" (android:label on activity).\n13. [x] (c) Automatic tuning detection (dsp/TuningDetector.kt, circular mean of cents deviations), fill From field + confidence line, fallback to 440; JVM tests with synthetic tones/chords at A=440/432/444.\n14. [x] (e) Built-in player: play/pause, seek bar with elapsed/total, A/B original<->converted at same position, survives rotation, stops on close; unit-test time formatting + A/B handoff helpers.\n15. [x] (d) ./gradlew test + assembleDebug; update AGENT_REPORT.md; commit locally (no push).\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":29,"oldLines":3,"newStart":29,"newLines":20,"lines":[" 13. [x] (c) Automatic tuning detection (dsp/TuningDetector.kt, circular mean of cents deviations), fill From field + confidence line, fallback to 440; JVM tests with synthetic tones/chords at A=440/432/444."," 14. [x] (e) Built-in player: play/pause, seek bar with elapsed/total, A/B original<->converted at same position, survives rotation, stops on close; unit-test time formatting + A/B handoff helpers."," 15. [x] (d) ./gradlew test + assembleDebug; update AGENT_REPORT.md; commit locally (no push).","+","+## Follow-up batch 2 (2026-11-08, from on-device test on Note10+)","+","+16. [ ] Conversion in a foreground service (mediaProcessing) with progress","+      notification, POST_NOTIFICATIONS runtime handling (must work if","+      denied), partial wake lock; stop + release on finish/fail.","+      Encoder: MediaMuxer.stop() before release() on success, delete","+      partial temp files on failure.","+17. [ ] State survives Activity recreation/reopen: process-level","+      ConversionRepository observed by the ViewModel; Back never loses a","+      running conversion; reopening shows progress or result + player.","+18. [ ] Tuning detection: always show best guess + \"use guess\" button on","+      low confidence; focus 200–2000 Hz; require peaks sustained across","+      consecutive frames; new test with sustained tones + noise/percussive","+      bursts + sliding LF tone.","+19. [ ] ./gradlew test + assembleDebug; update AGENT_REPORT.md; commit","+      locally (no push, no phone install)."]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false,"contentNotInModelContext":true},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"call_13f32f5d680046f79b681f03","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
