{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_cc0e88baa181454fa00dde40","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"Qwen3.8-Flash-Next GSQ-RCO IQ3_S","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Note: matching to previous peak — `best.sustain + 1` uses the previous frame's accumulated sustain (persisted via the copied Peak). Good.\n\nNext, update ConvertViewModel:\n- Remove the conversion execution (moved to the service), add startConversion which starts the service.\n- Observe ConversionRepository in init.\n- detectTuning: always display the best estimate with trust flag; Detected has a `trusted` field.\n- Add \"Use guess\" support to MainActivity.\n\nLet's rewrite ConvertViewModel.\n","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":75189,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7bbac423-c721-4d38-aad7-f0828aa806c1","uuid":"14b9be20-2c24-4b6a-92ab-f87f2eb242d9","timestamp":"2026-11-08T12:00:54.110Z","thinking_duration_ms":1260,"thinking_display":"updates"}
