{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_3a406e22797249209e4e0be2","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"Qwen3.8-Flash-Next GSQ-RCO IQ3_S","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All green: 21 tests (10+6+3+1+1), APK build successful.\n\nWait — one design detail to double-check regarding MainActivity: the `shownFileUri` update uses `displayName(inUri)` on the main thread for each collect — this runs a contentResolver query. Only once per new uri. Acceptable.\n\nAlso verifying: `useDetectedBtn` is declared as lateinit and assigned ✓ (patch 1). `getString(R.string.use_guess, String.format...)` — use_guess has %1$s ✓.\n\nAlso, `notPerReq`… no, notifPermReq is declared and used ✓.\n\nPotential runtime concerns: Android 14 (target 34) dataSync FGS started from a foregrounded Activity — allowed. Note10+ on Android 12 — no issue.\n\nAlso verify the ConvertViewModel.startConversion snippet `_state.update { it.copy(inputUri = input, detected = _state.value.detected, ...) }` — the detected copy is redundant but harmless.\n\nNext, update PLAN.md (check off 16–19) and update AGENT_REPORT.md (append a batch-2 section). Then commit locally.\n\nAGENT_REPORT: add a new section \"Follow-up batch 2\" describing the following:\n- Foreground service (ConvertService), dataSync rationale (mediaProcessing not in the installed android-34 platform's attrs/ServiceInfo; note the 10-minute dataSync limit on Android 14), notification handling (channel, POST_NOTIFICATIONS ask but continue even if denied), wake lock with timeout, stopSelf/stopForeground/release on finish/fail.\n- Encoder finalization: muxer.stop() before release, delete partial file on failure; the service also deletes the cache temp file.\n- State restoration: ConversionRepository is process-wide; VM init collects it; Back doesn't lose the conversion; on resume show progress/result, file line \"(from last conversion)\".\n- Tuning: minHz 200, sustained peak (minSustain=3, matchTol 3 bins, √sustain weight), on low confidence best-guess + button, sample values (mix test 0.998 / 444.004 Hz).\n- Tests: 21 tests, list the commands.\n- What needs to be verified on real device: notification behavior when permission denied, dataSync start restrictions under Samsung FreecessController, wake lock effectiveness against the freezer, A/B after resumption, guess button on actual hip-hop FLAC.\n\nAppend the report; then commit. Also update the batch test count header from 20 to 21.\n\nFor AGENT_REPORT edits: append a new section before \"## Build & test commands\" and update the numbers in that section. Simpler: update the numbers in the existing build/test section and insert a batch-2 section after the batch-1 sections (before \"## Build & test commands\"). Use python.\n","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":92355,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7bbac423-c721-4d38-aad7-f0828aa806c1","uuid":"2f29049e-fa77-4ef3-86ed-224b8e001afe","timestamp":"2026-11-08T12:03:33.647Z","thinking_duration_ms":5711,"thinking_display":"updates"}
