Saved to…\" + player, and labels the restored input \"(from last conversion)\". Nothing conversion-related runs in `viewModelScope` anymore.\n\n**(3) Tuning detection.** Low-confidence results now keep the best guess and show \"Tuning unclear: best guess A≈441.0 Hz (confidence 0.18), using 440\" plus a **\"Use detected A≈441.0 Hz\"** button. The detector gained a **200–2000 Hz floor** and a **sustained-peak gate** (same pitch within 3 bins must appear in ≥3 consecutive frames; weight scaled by √sustain) — 808 bass and one-off drum hits drop out. Stress test (A=444 sustained chord vs 40–190 Hz sweep + percussive bursts + hiss): **detected 444.004 Hz, confidence 0.998**; the original 432/440/444 tests pass unchanged at 1.000.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `./gradlew test` → BUILD SUCCESSFUL, **21 tests, 0 failures** (Dsp 10, TuningDetector 6, AbSwitch 3, Converter 1, TimeFormat 1).\n- `./gradlew assembleDebug` → BUILD SUCCESSFUL, APK at `app/build/outputs/apk/debug/app-debug.apk` (5.7 MB).\n\n**Still needs on-device checking** (compile-verified only here): the service actually beating FreecessController end-to-end, notification visible/denied paths, re-attach after Back during a run, and the new detector on Jason's actual hip-hop FLAC — the 0.18 case should now read much higher."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":97174,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7bbac423-c721-4d38-aad7-f0828aa806c1","uuid":"63cd01da-2c71-4b06-afd1-0570faab354a","timestamp":"2026-11-08T12:04:13.452Z"}
